From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Z96A <z96a@local>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 20:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] rk3568: raise APLL_HZ to 1416 MHz for faster boot

Mainline leaves APLL_HZ at 816 MHz for the whole U-Boot proper stage.
Loading ~65 MiB Image+initrd from eMMC is noticeably slow. Vendor
firmware uses 1416 MHz as the SCMI clk-init rate; match that here so
U-Boot stays at the same early frequency ATF will set.

Signed-off-by: Z96A <z96a@local>
---
 arch/arm/include/asm/arch-rockchip/cru_rk3568.h | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm/include/asm/arch-rockchip/cru_rk3568.h b/arch/arm/include/asm/arch-rockchip/cru_rk3568.h
index 111111111111..222222222222 100644
--- a/arch/arm/include/asm/arch-rockchip/cru_rk3568.h
+++ b/arch/arm/include/asm/arch-rockchip/cru_rk3568.h
@@ -11,7 +11,7 @@
 #define KHz		1000
 #define OSC_HZ		(24 * MHz)
 
-#define APLL_HZ		(816 * MHz)
+#define APLL_HZ		(1416 * MHz)
 #define GPLL_HZ		(1188 * MHz)
 #define CPLL_HZ		(1000 * MHz)
 #define PPLL_HZ		(200 * MHz)
-- 
Armbian
